  "worked_solution": "First, let's recall the following identity: \n\n$$\n{cot}^{2}\u2061\\theta ={csc}^{2}\u2061\\theta -1\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above identity into the given expression, and then factoring it as a difference of squares, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}\u2061\\theta {cot}^{2}\u2061\\theta }{\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta -1}-\\operatorname{cot}\u2061\\theta  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}\u2061\\theta ({csc}^{2}\u2061\\theta -1)}{\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta -1}-\\operatorname{cot}\u2061\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}\u2061\\theta (\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta +1)(\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta -1)}{\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta -1}-\\operatorname{cot}\u2061\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}\u2061\\theta (\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta +1)\\cancel{(\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta -1)}}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta -1}}-\\operatorname{cot}\u2061\\theta  \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}\u2061\\theta (\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta +1)-\\operatorname{cot}\u2061\\theta  \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}\u2061\\theta \\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta +\\operatorname{cos}\u2061\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}\u2061\\theta  \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cot}\u2061\\theta +\\operatorname{cos}\u2061\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}\u2061\\theta  \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}\u2061\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
